# agy store, ADR-0040 C6 (stage 4 of the agy spike, 2026-11-12).
# Windows 11, agy 1.5.6, isolated root --gemini_dir=<tmp>\gd (auth from the Windows keyring),
# cwd = a scratch git repo <tmp>\repo, stdin = a file or /dev/null (never a terminal).
# Spawned by a Python harness (subprocess, own pid); <tmp> = %LOCALAPPDATA%\Temp\agy782s4.

